flushHeaders, then writes with no length: "POST / HTTP/1.1|Transfer-Encoding: chunked||2|ab|3|cde|0||"
GET after flushHeaders: "GET / HTTP/1.1||"
array headers, no length: the first chunk came before end()
array headers, no length, two writes: "POST / HTTP/1.1|x-a: 1|Transfer-Encoding: chunked||2|ab|2|cd|0||"
write(), then end() in one tick: "POST / HTTP/1.1|x-a: 1|Transfer-Encoding: chunked||2|ab|2|cd|0||"
end(data) alone: "POST / HTTP/1.1|x-a: 1|Content-Length: 4||abcd"
object headers, a write, then end() once the server has it: "POST / HTTP/1.1|x-a: 1|Transfer-Encoding: chunked||2|ab|2|cd|0||"
array headers with Transfer-Encoding chunked: "POST / HTTP/1.1|Transfer-Encoding: chunked||2|ab|2|cd|0||"
